 potentially generated value"}]},{"label":"Non-member functions","children":[{"label":"operator==, operator!=","note":"compares two distribution objects"},{"label":"operator<<, operator>>","note":"performs stream input and output on pseudo-random number distribution"}]},{"label":"Example","note":"std::geometric_distribution<>(0.5) is the default and represents the number of coin tosses that are required to get heads."}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":358,"codeBlockCount":2}
